        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "as i mentioned, `:set guicursor=` requires 0.12.4 or master.\n\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/commit/bb6f5c3b318b9b1797920008a417aabbcc133c45 was an intentional change which requires *your terminal* to work properly. if your terminal doesn't work properly, then `:set guicursor=` is a workaround that disables cursor changes entirely.",
            "created_at": "2026-07-06T08:46:22Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/40560#issuecomment-4890821741",
