        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "It is this commit: 5cbb9d613bf6d8983b5effd7e20343a4ef497c06 that introduces a blinking cursor, also for `xterm` with `TERM=xterm-256color` and `./build/bin/nvim --clean +'set guicursor='`.\nIn this case, the cursor already blinks in the freshly started nvim, and continues to blink after I exit.\nAnd I have this behaviour also on `master`.",
